==English==
[[Image:Flag of Hezbollah.svg|thumb|right|Flag of Hezbollah]]
===Etymology===
Arabic {{ARchar|[[حزب الله]]}} ''party of God''.

===Alternative spellings===
*[[Hizbollah]]

===Proper noun===
{{wikipedia}}
'''Hezbollah'''

# a [[radical]] [[political]] and [[military]] [[organization]] that [[arose]] after the [[Israeli]] [[invasion]] of [[Lebanon]]; often accused of [[terrorism]].

